# Text files use LF line endings in the repository and in every checkout,
# Windows included. Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) checks
# files out with CRLF, so byte-for-byte checks such as
# `npm run check:category-seed` fail and diffs fill with line-ending noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary files.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
